OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fand becoming generally cloudy, but the
OL,7,Fcloud thinning and breaking at times
OL,8,Ftowards the west. However, a little
OL,9,Fpatchy rain could push through Kintyre
OL,10,Fand parts of the west coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FMainly dry, starting quite
OL,13,Fcloudy but with hazy sunshine breaking
OL,14,Fthrough at times. Some showery bursts
OL,15,Fof rain possible through Ayrshire,
OL,16,FArran and the Hebrides in the
OL,17,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
