OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMostly cloudy with rain or showers at
OL,7,Ftimes, the rain perhaps heavy and
OL,8,Fthundery. Some drier and brighter
OL,9,Fspells possible.
